{"4997060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BREACH", "steam_appid": 4997060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/ba001eb44b2e1593c04fb964cf2707cd.poster.avif?t=1788273696\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/ba001eb44b2e1593c04fb964cf2707cd.webm?t=1788273696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/ba001eb44b2e1593c04fb964cf2707cd.mp4?t=1788273696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREACH</strong> is a fast-paced action psychological Horror FPS set inside the facilities of Helix Construct Systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a test subject.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside an experimental facility with no clear way out, you will have to fight, run, and improvise your way through a series of increasingly dangerous Chambers. Every room is designed to test you. Every system is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something is very wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/e07abf1657527c619175442c24f08ea4.avif?t=1788273696\" width=1042 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is controlled by ATLAS, an advanced artificial intelligence responsible for monitoring your movements, operating the Chambers, and maintaining the facility. ATLAS sees everything you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper into the facility, you'll encounter experimental technology, deadly tests, strange machinery, and threats that don't always play by the rules. Move fast. Think faster. Use whatever the facility gives you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chambers are waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But ATLAS has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/b18ba3afbac6f91baddbfb64a7cede27.avif?t=1788273696\" width=968 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;this game si really cool&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Max</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;idk a quote that doesnt have any words that is another game or company&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-soulsuz</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;i like breach i’m evil guy&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-inspoth (VA for Elias Varn)</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/ba001eb44b2e1593c04fb964cf2707cd.poster.avif?t=1788273696\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/ba001eb44b2e1593c04fb964cf2707cd.webm?t=1788273696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/ba001eb44b2e1593c04fb964cf2707cd.mp4?t=1788273696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BREACH</strong> is a fast-paced action psychological Horror FPS set inside the facilities of Helix Construct Systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a test subject.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside an experimental facility with no clear way out, you will have to fight, run, and improvise your way through a series of increasingly dangerous Chambers. Every room is designed to test you. Every system is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And something is very wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/e07abf1657527c619175442c24f08ea4.avif?t=1788273696\" width=1042 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is controlled by ATLAS, an advanced artificial intelligence responsible for monitoring your movements, operating the Chambers, and maintaining the facility. ATLAS sees everything you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you push deeper into the facility, you'll encounter experimental technology, deadly tests, strange machinery, and threats that don't always play by the rules. Move fast. Think faster. Use whatever the facility gives you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chambers are waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But ATLAS has other plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4997060/extras/b18ba3afbac6f91baddbfb64a7cede27.avif?t=1788273696\" width=968 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >